    <y-text id="jtrl" tag="Description">
        <p>Reverend Cecil is a stout mole cleric from the deep-root parish of Mossburrow, tending to the spiritual and medicinal needs of the burrow communities with patient paws and a gentle voice.</p>
    </y-text>
